   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Inclusive and Gender Responsive Economic Development in Cities &#x2018;IncluCity&#x2019; aims to promote inclusive and gender responsive local economic development in cities. The programme focuses on reducing inequalities that affect vulnerable populations including women and girls, persons with disabilities, slum dwellers, minorities, and marginalized groups. The programme is implemented in close collaboration with other LDF programmes of UNCDF and will support the priorities of the International Municipal Investment Fund (IMIF).</narrative>
